d 'SREG': module to provide ATE estimation and inference in stratified randomized experiments
d
d  sreg provides estimation and inference for average treatment
d effects in stratified randomized experiments. It implements
d design-specific treatment-effect estimators and variance
d estimators for matched pairs, general k-tuple designs, large
d strata of potentially unequal sizes, and designs combining small
d and large strata. The package accommodates multiple treatments,
d individual- and cluster-level treatment assignment, and optional
d linear covariate adjustment. It reports treatment effects
d relative to control, standard errors, test statistics, p-values,
d and asymptotic confidence intervals. Companion commands generate
d experimental data and plot estimated treatment effects. 
d
d KW: randomized experiments; stratification; average treatment effects;
d
d Requires: Stata version 14.2
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260925
d
d Author: Juri Trifonov ,  Northwestern University
d Support: email  jutrifonov@@u.northwestern.edu
d
d Author: Yuehao Bai ,  University of Southern California
d Support: email yuehao.bai@@usc.edu
d
d Author: Azeem Shaikh ,  University of Chicago
d Support: email amshaikh@@uchicago.edu
d
d Author: Max Tabord-Meehan ,  University of Toronto
d Support: email m.tabordmeehan@@utoronto.ca
d
